From e686c5f4975c14e572b79bf2fa85c5397703482e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:17:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(library): publish documents only, add excludeFolders,
 topic filter and pagination

The first indexed run published all 1,512 files of a project-dump folder (482 images,
64 zips, 65 html, media, site source) and bundled a 690 KB index into the site.
Now only pdf/slides/doc are published (363 files, 149 KB). Excluded folders are never
entered. Bulk skips are counted in the audit file rather than listed.
---
 README.md                        |     7 +
 content/library.config.json      |    30 +-
 scripts/__tests__/drive.test.mjs |    65 +-
 scripts/sync-drive.mjs           |    36 +-
 src/data/library.generated.json  | 17498 +----------------------------
 src/pages/Library.tsx            |    67 +-
 6 files changed, 526 insertions(+), 17177 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 9caec27..2ffd783 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -122,6 +122,13 @@ thesis, study, গবেষণা) becomes **Research**; every other file goes b
 **PDF**, slides to **Presentations**, the rest to **Other files**. Sub-folders are
 walked (up to `maxDepth`) and shown as a label on each card.
 
+**What is published.** Only the file types in `kinds` (default PDF, slides, Word-style
+documents). Images, zips, HTML, audio/video, code and spreadsheets are never listed,
+so a working-directory folder cannot become a public file listing. To keep a folder
+out entirely, add its name to `excludeFolders` — it is never entered, which the
+tests verify. Counts of everything skipped are written to
+`src/data/library-skipped.generated.json`.
+
 **Zero credentials (works today):** share the folder as *Anyone with the link →
 Viewer*. The page shows Drive's own folder view, click-to-load.
 
